# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
.ruff_cache/

# Node
node_modules/
.next/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Environment
.env
.env.local

# Audio + models — never commit these
#
# The golden evaluation fixtures (eval/golden/) are the one exception and need
# `git add -f`. They are human recordings, they are small, and they are the only
# audio in the repository. See IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md m11.
audio_data/

# Anchored with a leading slash, and that slash is load-bearing. An unanchored
# `models/` matches a directory called `models` at EVERY level, which on 2026-08-30
# silently excluded `api/models/` — the Pydantic layer — from `git add`. The pattern is
# meant for a top-level cache of downloaded weights; the extension patterns below are
# what catch weight files wherever they land.
/models/
*.wav
*.webm
*.mp3
*.onnx
*.bin
*.pt

# The m0 spike is throwaway; its findings move to docs/decisions/
spike/

# Agent phase artefacts — regenerated per milestone, never tracked (D18).
#
# These describe how the work is produced, not what was produced. PR bodies are written
# for `gh pr create --body-file`; SESSION-HANDOFF.md is a live state file rewritten every
# session; GIT-COMMANDS.md is a personal paste sheet; CLAUDE.md binds agents working in
# this checkout and means nothing to a reader of the repository.
#
# PRD.md and speaklab-agent/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md are NOT here. They are the product
# specification and the build plan, they are what a reviewer actually wants, and README
# and docs/architecture.md both link to them.
.pr-bodies/
CLAUDE.md
speaklab-agent/SESSION-HANDOFF.md
speaklab-agent/GIT-COMMANDS.md

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# macOS
.DS_Store

# The half of the error golden set that cannot be published. It is real recorded speech
# about somebody's real work; the role-play half ships in labels.json and manifest.json.
# eval/golden/errors/build.py writes the .local files from the database when the labels
# are there, and the measurement suite prefers them and says which set it used.
eval/golden/errors/labels.local.json
eval/golden/errors/manifest.local.json

# What a `make eval` run produced, before eval/report.py turns it into
# docs/evaluation.md. Raw per-suite JSON, rewritten from scratch on every run and
# meaningless without the date it was taken on. The report is the artefact; this is the
# scratch space it is rendered from.
.eval/
